  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Hughes de Lasteyrie du Saillant was a French activist investor based in Brussels. After early roles at BNP and Louis Dreyfus, he built substantial positions in listed companies and pressed boards for change. His challenge to France’s exit tax reached Europe’s highest court, while his Rhodia campaign made him a prominent shareholder advocate.",
    "html": "<p>Hughes de Lasteyrie du Saillant was a French activist investor based in Brussels. After early roles at BNP and Louis Dreyfus, he built substantial positions in listed companies and pressed boards for change. His challenge to France’s exit tax reached Europe’s highest court, while his Rhodia campaign made him a prominent shareholder advocate.</p>\r\n",
